      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "I’ve confirmed a few facts for your HAT045 issue:\n\n- User ID: mei_brown_7075\n- Reservation: 3JA7XV\n- Flight: HAT045\n- Route/date: PHX to SEA on 2024-05-15\n- Current status: delayed\n- Passengers on the reservation: 4\n- Cabin: business\n\nUnder our policy, for a delayed flight complaint where the customer wants compensation, I can offer a certificate after confirming the facts. Since there are 4 passengers, the available amount is:\n\n- $50 × 4 passengers = $200 certificate\n\nI’m not able to refund delay compensation to the original payment method. Under the policy, the compensation available here is a certificate, not a cash/card refund.\n\nIf you want, I can also help change or cancel the reservation if that is what you’d like to do. Per policy, the delay-related certificate can be offered after the reservation is changed or cancelled.\n\nSo at this point, your available compensation option is:\n- $200 future travel certificate\n\nIf you want to proceed with a reservation change or cancellation first so I can then help with the eligible compensation path, tell me which you want to do.",
