      "tool_calls": []
    },
    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "No, I do not want to change or cancel the reservation, and I’m not asking to be transferred.\n\nThis is really frustrating. I’m a Gold member, I’m in business class, and this delay is causing me to miss an important meeting. I need you to work with me here.\n\nIf you truly cannot do anything back to the original payment method and you cannot increase the amount, then I want you to confirm clearly: if I keep the reservation exactly as is, you’re offering nothing at all for the delay? Because that’s a pretty terrible outcome.\n\nAnd if the only compensation you can provide is the $200 future travel certificate tied to changing or canceling, then say that plainly. If that is absolutely the best and only option you can offer, I’ll take the voucher option as a last resort, but I’m very unhappy about it.",
